// prelude.inc - plain-C++ stand-ins for the names the bodies call.
//
// NO MLIR, LLVM OR dcc HEADER IS INCLUDED ANYWHERE IN THIS CAMPAIGN. This file is a
// NAME INVENTORY, not a compilable prelude: the stand-ins carry names and arity
// only, so the consolidated TU stands alone textually. It is declared out_of_scope
// in wavefront-config.json and NOTHING IN IT IS TO BE PORTED - the behaviour to
// port lives entirely in the bodies in sentient.cpp.
//
// 864 distinct external names, 6362 call sites.

